:"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3CRNiQ4HbGdo35ltp9ndxg","review_id":"LYQj5rKLQ0qIbn7ZzzjPAQ","date":"2011-06-22T15:29:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9227184057235718,"text_excerpt":"I work on Frenchmen St, so I eat here practically every day. It's sooo cheap and sooo delicious. The po-boys are especially good, as well as the chicken/seafood platters & french fries. The fried rice is okay but tastes better with hot sauce. They have quite a wide variety of beverages for such a small place. Another plus is the credit card minimum is only $5. It is a tiny, cramped place, so best to call ahead rather than wait in line. I was quite impressed that I was able to pick-up 2 shrimp po-boys on Mardi Gras Day, 15 minutes after I called in the order, with a line out the door."},{"business_id":"3CRNiQ4HbGdo35ltp9ndxg","review_id":"ssZvmqgz3aFLmOTa0YKrZA","date":"2011-10-08T17:21:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9112414121627808,"text_excerpt":"This place is all right. I went there the other day with my BFF and we got 1) red beans and rice with sausage, 2) shrimp fried rice, and 3) a grilled chicken sandwich. The chicken sandwich was big and she wolfed it down. The red beans and rice were good, and even though I normally don't eat meat, for some reason I decided to get them with sausage (you can get them without). It tasted kind of odd, but I really do think that's just because I'm not used to eating meat. But they were good. I saved the sausage for my friend, and she ate it and enjoyed it. The shrimp fried rice was fine. Not bad, not great, just greasy shrimp fried rice. I don't recommend this place if you're craving greasy, ch..."},{"business_id":"3CRNiQ4HbGdo35ltp9ndxg","review_id":"OxAfx-U6HlsLfF86wKhVsA","date":"2018-02-20T02:22:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8934575319290161,"text_excerpt":"The bahn mis are to die for. The shrimp and pork belly are my go to. The pickled veggies on top just make it even better. The guys that run the place are super nice and it's decently quick to get in and out."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3CRNiQ4HbGdo35ltp9ndxg","photo_id":"nUk0Idsjs_SEWZ4AJilY5A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nUk0Idsjs_SEWZ4AJilY5A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9535807371139526},{"business_id":"3CRNiQ4HbGdo35ltp9ndxg","photo_id":"7gE3uu1OkkYcVUp_tHvN6w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7gE3uu1OkkYcVUp_tHvN6w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9535806179046631}]},"notebook_case":null}
